    <title>Adarsh R. Kumar</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Adarsh R. Kumar — undergraduate at SCU studying Electrical and Computer Engineering." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page-shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <h1>Adarsh R. Kumar</h1>
        <p>Undergraduate at SCU | Electrical &amp; Computer Engineering | Class of 2029</p>
      </header>

      <section aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
        <p>Web developer, programmer, and tech enthusiast. I enjoy building projects, exploring technology, and learning how things work.</p>
        <p>Visit my <a href="https://adarshrkumar.dev" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">website</a> to see more of my work.</p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="interests-title">
        <h2 id="interests-title">Interests</h2>
